     1136     (output varinvprb
     1137     )  .
     1138      find first in-vatp_doc-attr no-lock
     1139       where in-vatp_doc-attr.doc-code  = buf_trn-doc.doc-code
     1140         and in-vatp_doc-attr.attr-code = 'envd':U
     1141       no-error .
